2.   Generates 10 random numbers using `` std::rand() % 256 ``.
3.   Adds each random number to the sum using `` fetch_add() ``.
4.   Returns nothing.

In the main function, we create 10 threads and call the `` thread_function() `` inside each thread. We then use `` join() `` to wait for all the threads to complete.

After all the threads have completed, we print the final value of `` sum ``.

